        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "Instruction-following assistants were rapidly moving from research demos into public products, making behavior and safety part of the model’s visible quality. Anthropic launched Claude with an explicit emphasis on helpfulness, honesty and harmlessness rather than capability benchmarks alone.",
