        },
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "That sounds like a promising direction. What mechanism actually makes it work?",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "Claude combines large language model pretraining with assistant-oriented post-training, while Anthropic’s Constitutional AI work supplies written principles for critique and revision. AI-generated preference feedback can then support reinforcement learning, reducing the need for humans to label every unsafe response directly.",
            "sourceIds": ["source-primary-record"],
            "claimIds": [
