        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "Experts generally treat Claude’s launch as a prominent alternative path for deploying general assistants with safety principles embedded in post-training. Its continuing influence lies in making model constitutions, self-critique and scalable oversight central topics in the design and evaluation of commercial AI assistants.",
